      "interpretation": "IDs, defaults, Unicode, nested values, error locations and no-invalid-write checks pass. BOM/UTF-16/UTF-32 and 210-level JSON retain the old parser through a fallback. JSON request schema and documented 422 remain; some validation wording/URLs differ.",
      "optimization": "Retain validation and legacy compatibility while changing the normal parsing path",
      "validation": "Before/after correctness logs pinned, including invalid BOM/UTF-16/UTF-32 requests. Isolated resources removed. Earlier attempts are preserved separately, not mixed into these results.",
